-only for impact. HARD LIMIT: No card may exceed 40 words of outline content.",visual:"VISUAL DECK STYLE: Each card gets a title and an image — no bullet points or body text in the outline. The images carry the story. Include an image idea note per card describing what visual to show.",classic:"CLASSIC DECK STYLE: Target 60-80 words of content per card. Vary bullet counts — ~10% title-only, ~15% single-bullet, ~50% two-bullet, ~25% dense 3-4+ bullets. HARD LIMIT: No content card may exceed 90 words. When a card exceeds 5 bullet points, condense to the 3 strongest. Use <p> sparingly (1-2 cards total).",consultant:"CONSULTANT DECK STYLE: Target 200-300 words per card. Dense and information-rich. Most cards get 3-4+ bullets with specific data, metrics, and structured arguments. HARD LIMIT: No card may exceed 320 words. Suggest charts and diagrams where data supports them. Demonstrate breadth of knowledge."},"f",0,a,"u",0,{},"P",0,"choose_for_me","E",0,"last_used","Y",0,r,"_",0,function(e){return"aiGenerated"===e||"aiAnimation"===e},"g",0,function(e){return{...r,...e}}])},549950,e=>{"use strict";var t=e.i(191788),r=e.i(979928),a=e.i(396460),n=e.i(495676);let i=()=>()=>{},o=()=>{let e=(0,t.useContext)(n.V),o=()=>e?(0,a.g)(e.store.getState().settings).styleTemplate:void 0,s=(0,t.useSyncExternalStore)(e?e.store.subscribe:i,o,o);return s?r.$[s]?.formatType:void 0};e.s(["s",0,e=>{let t=(0,a.g)(e).styleTemplate;return(0,r.h)(t?r.$[t]?.formatType:void 0)},"t",0,()=>(0,r.h)(o()),"L",0,o])},582690,864652,771401,696305,597514,932049,883838,113957,411045,e=>{"use strict";var t=e.i(755453),r=e.i(477341),a=e.i(308822),n=e.i(8518),i=e.i(154258);e.i(768169);var o=e.i(388773),s=e.i(399685),l=e.i(676095),d=e.i(952660),c=e.i(936265),u=e.i(383865),p=e.i(520100),f=e.i(70146),h=e.i(13948),m=e.i(241507),g=e.i(639014),b=e.i(807727),x=e.i(391736);e.i(988162);var y=e.i(391303),v=e.i(196444),S=e.i(357128),j=e.i(78105),w=e.i(457752),C=e.i(55204),k=e.i(54182),A=e.i(175863),T=e.i(332600);e.i(838054